    "ruleType": "unit-ability",
    "group": "Librarian Dreadnought",
    "summary": "Once per turn, as [your Movement phase](vsdata:core-rule/movement-phase) ends, you can have one **PSYKER** of yours with this ability use it, rolling a D6:\n\n- 1: that **PSYKER** takes D3 **[mortal wounds](vsdata:core-rule/mortal-wounds)**\n- 2+: pick an **ADEPTUS ASTARTES INFANTRY** unit of yours up to 12\" from that **PSYKER**, then remove it and set it back up anywhere on the battlefield more than 8\" horizontally from every enemy model",
